/T (Joe E.)
/Contents (The so-called Big Bang Nucleosynthesis model \(BBN\) provides a framework under which the lightest nuclides \(including ^7Li\) are produced within the first 3 minutes of the universe's existence. For the most part, its predictions have conformed well with primordial light abundances.)
