/T (Joe E.)
/Contents (With the advent of programs such as WMAP \(Wilkinson Microwave Anisotropy Probe\), there has been a newfound availability of data to provide measurements of cosmic baryon densities, which can be used to assess theoretical predictions. While deuterium has conformed strongly to BBN/CMB predictions, ^7Li has been less frequent than predictions by a factor of 3-4 \(or 4-5 sigma\).)
